            "value": "NOTE",
            "note": "NOTE$ea_notes=Examples include a national identification number, a student ID, national fiscal number, etc. We also refer to the <a href=\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/oj\">eIDAS regulation</a> on \"electronic identification and trust services\" and its <a href=\"https://docs.swedenconnect.se/technical-framework/mirror/eidas/eIDAS_SAML_Attribute_Profile_v1.2-FINAL.pdf#page=5\">mapping</a> to the Core Person Vocabulary."
